</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expression profiles of 290 ESTs mapped to chromosome 3 in human epithelial ovarian cancer cell lines using DNA expression oligonucleotide microarrays</article-title><source>Genome Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>112</fpage><lpage>121</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11779836</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1101/gr.174202</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Manderson</surname><given-names>EN</given-names></name><name><surname>Presneau</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Provencher</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Mes-Masson</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Tonin</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparative analysis of loss of heterozygosity of specific chromosome 3, 13, 17, and X loci and TP53 mutations in human epithelial ovarian cancer</article-title><source>Mol Carcinog</source><year>2002</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>78</fpage><lpage>90</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12112314</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/mc.10051</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Presneau</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Dewar</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Forgetta</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Provencher</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Mes-Masson</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Tonin</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Loss of heterozygosity and transcriptome analyses of a 1.2 Mb candidate ovarian cancer tumor suppressor locus region at 17q25.1-q25.2</article-title><source>Mol Carcinog</source><year>2